		</div>

		<div class="social-links">
			<a href="https://youtube.com/@mohammedadel1983?si=MFteneUFNSBJLrlB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-i18n data-en="YouTube" data-ar="يوتيوب">يوتيوب</a>
			<a href="https://www.threads.net/@alsehawaaltabia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-i18n data-en="Threads" data-ar="ثريدز">ثريدز</a>
			<a href="https://www.instagram.com/alsehawaaltabia?igsh=MTY5eHdhMG9uOWFweA==" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-i18n data-en="Instagram" data-ar="انستجرام">انستجرام</a>
			<a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1LLusCaezP/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-i18n data-en="Facebook" data-ar="فيس بوك">فيس بوك</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="footer-grid">
		<div>
			<h3 data-i18n data-en="About Us" data-ar="من نحن">من نحن</h3>
			<p data-i18n data-en="Learn more about SHYM365.ORG and our mission." data-ar="تعرف أكثر على SHYM365.ORG ورسالتنا.">تعرف أكثر على SHYM365.ORG ورسالتنا.</p>
			<a class="footer-link" href="/about" data-i18n data-en="About Us" data-ar="من نحن">من نحن</a>
		</div>

		<div>
			<h3 data-i18n data-en="Support Us" data-ar="شجعنا">شجعنا</h3>
			<p data-i18n data-en="Help us deliver more health and nature tools for everyone." data-ar="ساعدنا في تقديم المزيد من الأدوات الصحية والطبيعية للجميع.">ساعدنا في تقديم المزيد من الأدوات الصحية والطبيعية للجميع.</p>
			<a class="footer-link" href="/support" data-i18n data-en="Visit Support Page" data-ar="اذهب لصفحة الدعم">اذهب لصفحة الدعم</a>
		</div>

		<div>
			<h3 data-i18n data-en="Contact Us" data-ar="اتصل بنا">اتصل بنا</h3>
			<p data-i18n data-en="Have questions? We'd love to hear from you." data-ar="لديك أسئلة؟ يسعدنا أن نسمع منك.">لديك أسئلة؟ يسعدنا أن نسمع منك.</p>
			<div class="contact-actions">
				<a class="footer-link" href="/contact" data-i18n data-en="Contact Us" data-ar="اتصل بنا">اتصل بنا</a>
				<a class="footer-link privacy-link" href="/privacy-policy">
					<svg class="privacy-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
						<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
					</svg>
					<span data-i18n data-en="Privacy Policy" data-ar="سياسة الخصوصية">سياسة الخصوصية</span>
				</a>
				<a class="footer-link terms-link" href="/terms-of-service">
					<svg class="terms-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
						<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
						<line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
						<line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
						<line x1="10" y1="9" x2="8" y2="9"></line>
					</svg>
					<span data-i18n data-en="Terms of Service" data-ar="شروط الاستخدام">شروط الاستخدام</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="footer-bottom">
		<p data-i18n data-en="&copy; 2026 SHYM365.ORG" data-ar="&copy; 2026 SHYM365.ORG">&copy; 2026 SHYM365.ORG</p>
		<div class="footer-actions">
			<a href="mailto:contact@shym365.org?subject=Error Report" class="report-link" data-i18n data-en="Report an Error" data-ar="إبلاغ عن خطأ">
				<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
					<line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
					<line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
				</svg>
				<span data-i18n data-en="Report an Error" data-ar="إبلاغ عن خطأ">إبلاغ عن خطأ</span>
			</a>
			<button onclick="window.print()" class="print-link" data-i18n data-en="Print Page" data-ar="طباعة الصفحة">
				<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9"></polyline>
					<path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path>
					<rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8"></rect>
				</svg>
				<span data-i18n data-en="Print Page" data-ar="طباعة الصفحة">طباعة الصفحة</span>
			</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		padding: 42px 32px 28px;
		margin-top: 32px;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(135, 168, 118, 0.16), transparent 35%),
			rgba(247, 251, 247, 0.96);
		border-radius: 32px;
		box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 132, 81, 0.08);
	}

	.footer-top {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 1.5fr) minmax(220px, 1fr);
		gap: 32px;
		align-items: start;
		padding-bottom: 28px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #1f5d39;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.1vw, 2.2rem);
		line-height: 1.05;
	}

	.footer-top p,
	.footer-grid p,
		.footer-bottom p {
		margin: 0;
		color: #475569;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.social-links {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(130px, auto));
		gap: 14px 16px;
		justify-content: start;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.social-links a,
	.footer-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 12px 18px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 132, 81, 0.14);
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #134e39;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.social-links a:hover,
	.footer-link:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
		background: #f8fdf6;
	}

	.footer-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 24px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.footer-grid > div {
		padding: 22px 20px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		border-radius: 22px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 132, 81, 0.08);
	}

	.footer-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		width: fit-content;
		margin-top: 12px;
	}

	.contact-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 16px;
	}

	.privacy-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.privacy-icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		stroke-width: 2.2;
	}

	.terms-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.terms-icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		stroke-width: 2.2;
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		margin-top: 30px;
		text-align: center;
		color: #5f6f7f;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.footer-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 16px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.report-link,
	.print-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		padding: 8px 14px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 132, 81, 0.14);
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #134e39;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.report-link:hover,
	.print-link:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
		background: #f8fdf6;
	}

	.report-link svg,
	.print-link svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 920px) {
		.footer-top,
		.footer-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.footer-top {
			padding-bottom: 24px;
		}

		.contact-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.site-footer {
			padding: 24px 20px 20px;
		}

		.social-links {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.footer-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.report-link,
		.print-link {
			width: 100%;
			justify-content: center;
		}
	}
</style>
